			"Message": "refactor(Air): Expose HTTP Client module and update Mist naming\n\nUpdate the HTTP module to export the full Client module instead of re-exporting individual functions. Also rename the mist crate reference to Mist (PascalCase) to align with Land's naming conventions.\n\nChanges: - HTTP/mod.rs: Replace re-exports with `pub mod Client;` - Client.rs: Update mist::Resolver to Mist::Resolver - Downloader, Updates, AirVinegRPCService: Update all calls to use `Mist::dns_port()` and `crate::HTTP::Client::...`",
