			],
			"Message": "style(Air): Reformat dev_log macros and imports across all modules\n\nReorganize dev_log imports from top-level `use crate::dev_log;` to inline imports alongside other crate dependencies. Expand dev_log! macro calls from single-line to multi-line format for improved readability:\n\n  Before: dev_log!(\"tag\", \"message\");\n  After:  dev_log!(\n      \"tag\",\n      \"message\"\n  );\n\nChanges applied to 30+ modules including ApplicationState, Authentication, Binary, Configuration, Daemon, Downloader, HealthCheck, Indexing, Updates, and Vine gRPC service. Also fixes minor formatting in generated protobuf code (air.rs).\n\nThis follows consistent code style patterns established in recent Air refactorings while preserving all existing functionality.",
			"SHA": "3beed3d79055927a6857ac76e7fc2084e26e7e88"
		}
